From 88f214cc34c1d021eb92102cee8faef0b3d7f3b0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 14:51:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Preserve builtin name scanning past case
 substitutions

Recognize lexical case pattern parentheses, quoted and heredoc regions, and line continuations without confusing them with substitution boundaries. Share pattern positions with the arithmetic scanner and memoize failed literal words to avoid repeated boundary walks. Preserve date exemptions and non-subscript data controls.
